+# OUF local Raft bbolt adapter
+
+Derived from github.com/hashicorp/raft-boltdb/v2 v2.4.2.
+Copyright and MPL-2.0 source-file notices and LICENSE are retained.
+
+Active store operations, bucket names, MessagePack encoding, fsync defaults,
+metrics and log/stable-store interfaces are unchanged from that release.
+Only the unused MigrateToV2 helper and its archived boltdb/bolt import, and
+that helper's upstream test, are omitted. SeaweedFS already uses the bbolt
+backend. No database format migration or conversion is performed here.
+
+OUF owns review and maintenance of this local adaptation. Upstream changes
+must be evaluated against these exact source inputs; this is not an upstream
+release or an assertion that all SeaweedFS dependencies are maintained.
